              <span class="api-hero__title-main">Citation Guide</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="api-lede">
              Find out how to easily cite materials from the Canadiana Collection. Citing Canadiana as a source for
              your research helps readers find critical primary sources and helps CRKN understand the impact that
              Canadiana has on research.
            </p>
